<h2 class="fw-bold">Privacy Notice</h2>
<p class="text-muted">Dwellr is a student pilot project. This notice explains how we handle your information.</p>

<h5 class="mt-4">What we collect</h5>
<p>Name, email, mobile number, budget and area preferences, property details, messages sent through the app, and demo wallet records.</p>

<h5 class="mt-4">Why</h5>
<p>To contact you about the pilot, connect renters with landlords, and verify landlords. Demo wallet payments use no real money.</p>

<h5 class="mt-4">Who can see it</h5>
<p>Only the Dwellr team and our hosting provider. We do not sell your information.</p>

<h5 class="mt-4">Landlord ID checks</h5>
<p>[Edit this to match reality, for example: we check IDs in person or by video call and do not keep copies.]</p>

<h5 class="mt-4">Your choices</h5>
<p>Ask us at [your team email] to see, correct, or delete your information at any time.</p>